# Optional. Machine-local path to a ClassMode Studio checkout, used by
# `npm run check:design-tokens-drift` INSTEAD of fetching from GitHub.
#
# You do not need this file — without it the check fetches the pinned ref from
# raw.githubusercontent.com, which is what CI does. Set it when you want to run
# the check offline, or diff against a specific local revision.
#
# Copy to `.classmode-studio-repo` (gitignored) and edit. One line, no quotes.
# The directory must contain app/globals.css or the check aborts.
#
# /Users/you/Development/classmode studio
